# Implementation Plan: History & Advanced Params

## Goal Description
Integrate the real History API to replace mock data in [HistoryView](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/features/history/HistoryView.tsx#18-98) and expose advanced analysis parameters in [AnalysisView](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/features/analysis/AnalysisView.tsx#11-294) to achieve feature parity with the legacy Tkinter GUI.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This requires backend changes to ensure [src/server.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/server.py) (or equivalent) accepts the new parameters and correctly serves history data.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend (`QualiaQC/src`)
#### [MODIFY] [server.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/server.py) (assuming location)
- Ensure `GET /api/history` scans `output/` and returns structured data matching the legacy logic.
- Ensure `POST /api/analysis/run` accepts: `symmetry`, `blur`, `aggregate`, `agg_kernel_size`, `agg_min_area`, `blur_kernel_size`, `shadow_removal_method`.

### Frontend ([QualiaQC/web-gui](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui))
#### [MODIFY] [HistoryView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/features/history/HistoryView.tsx)
- Replace `MOCK_HISTORY` with `useQuery` hooking into `/api/history`.
- Implement "Regenerate" button logic (likely a new API endpoint or re-triggering analysis).

#### [MODIFY] [AnalysisView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/features/analysis/AnalysisView.tsx)
- Add "Advanced Settings" collapsible section.
- Add inputs for:
    - **Toggles**: `Symmetry`, `Blur`, `Aggregate`.
    - **Numeric**: `Blur Kernel` (int), `Agg Kernel` (int), `Agg Min Area` (float).
    - **Select**: `Shadow Removal` (CLAHE, etc.).
- Update `analysisMutation` to send these fields.

## Verification Plan
### Automated Tests
- None planned for this phase.

### Manual Verification
1.  **History**: Open "History" tab, verify real `.gri` files from `output/` are listed.
2.  **Analysis**: Run analysis with non-default "Advanced Settings" (e.g., disable Blur) and verify the visual output changes (or logs reflect the params).
